Upstream ggml-org/llama.cpp 3dbcb7fca (#30296, "cpu : reduce AVX2 tiled accumulators together"), MIT.
The AVX2 tiled K-quant microkernel reduced each of its 8 int32 accumulators with its own horizontal sum;
hadd + permute now reduce them together. Integer additions modulo 2^32, so the outputs are bit-identical.

